From ce357d84aced5440a353056dc3fce4bb19e3e3a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shacohen76 <shacohen76@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 14:46:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NW1: make siteUrl env-driven for multi-domain support

- CONFIG.siteUrl reads NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL env var, falls back to thewinner.ae
- All hardcoded thewinner.ae URLs in metadata/hreflang/structured data now use CONFIG.siteUrl
- Privacy/terms legal text uses dynamic hostname
- Admin dashboard UI strings use dynamic hostname
- TrackingProvider referrer check covers both thewinner.ae and thewinners.ae
- No behavior change for thewinner.ae (fallback = identical to before)
